WEBVTT

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:16.570
Episode 9

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:39.170
Project coordinator and song translator: Nemie

00:00:39.270 --> 00:00:49.270
Translators: Nemie, tamaramin

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:46.690
Rain!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.280
It's raining!

00:00:48.280 --> 00:00:50.060
Rain! It's rain!

00:00:49.370 --> 00:00:59.370
Beta Editor: Sana

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:51.940
Heaven heard us!

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.870
Finally it started to rain!

00:00:53.870 --> 00:00:56.450
It's rain!

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.480
It's raining!

00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:09.470
Typesetters: Nemie, Sana

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.870
Rain!

00:01:34.610 --> 00:01:36.140
Gwangjong...

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:28.130
A new hero is born, a hero

00:02:28.130 --> 00:02:31.090
No, how could he hide the scar?

00:02:31.650 --> 00:02:33.380
I think it's about cosmetics

00:02:33.380 --> 00:02:36.900
I don't know who did it, but he is very talented

00:02:43.390 --> 00:02:46.530
No wonder Heaven chose our 4th brother

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:50.080
Now don't treat So so casually

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:17.570
This is the 4th prince

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:21.940
Prince Wang So is Gwangjong

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:27.990
His brothers, nephews and subjects...

00:03:27.990 --> 00:03:31.020
They say he killed them all

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:32.850
Tot Gwangjeong

00:03:33.380 --> 00:03:34.700
Killed?

00:03:43.860 --> 00:03:47.390
Your Highness, you saved us!

00:03:47.390 --> 00:03:50.520
You are our savior!

00:03:51.230 --> 00:03:52.860
You saved us all!

00:03:52.860 --> 00:03:54.110
Thank you!

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.570
Thank you!

00:03:57.010 --> 00:03:59.120
Will he become emperor because of me?

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:00.960
Because she covered up his scar?

00:04:01.470 --> 00:04:04.600
No, his name has already been written down in history

00:04:04.600 --> 00:04:08.080
Even if I hadn't done this, he would still have become one.

00:04:20.360 --> 00:04:25.130
But Prince Wang So and the truth of his brothers...

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:32.040
Suh, it's raining

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:34.000
The Emperor will celebrate this

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:39.330
Su, what's the matter?

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:43.000
Will everyone die because of me?

00:04:44.440 --> 00:04:45.630
What?

00:04:46.480 --> 00:04:47.900
This man...

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:52.200
will he become like this because of me?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:54.320
Yes?

00:04:56.960 --> 00:04:59.060
You must not get hurt!

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:28.620
The 4th Prince was chosen by Heaven

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:35.740
It can't be that they chose him

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:40.270
It should have been me

00:05:40.270 --> 00:05:42.350
This is my place

00:05:42.350 --> 00:05:45.050
I had to bring the rain!

00:06:06.740 --> 00:06:07.820
Mother...

00:06:07.820 --> 00:06:10.020
How could you miss such an opportunity?

00:06:10.700 --> 00:06:12.550
If someone wants to take what's yours,

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:15.250
you must rip his throat out, but protect yours!

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.350
You had to do it no matter what!

00:06:17.350 --> 00:06:19.500
A mistake... it's a mistake, mother

00:06:19.500 --> 00:06:21.890
- I also tend to make mistakes!
- No

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:23.970
There were no errors

00:06:24.340 --> 00:06:29.360
The emperor's mother and son must be persistent and ruthless!

00:06:30.890 --> 00:06:32.810
Maid Hae from Damiwon

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:36.880
I'm sure she covered up So's scar

00:06:37.880 --> 00:06:40.780
Mother, should I raise you?

00:06:40.780 --> 00:06:43.080
Damivon, Damivon, Damivon!

00:06:43.770 --> 00:06:46.450
All the girls from this palace are causing trouble!

00:06:46.450 --> 00:06:50.020
I'll burn this place down

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:00.920
4th Prince So came to see His Majesty

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:10.830
Prince Wang So, you have accomplished a great feat

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:13.120
You saved this state

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:16.920
I just performed the ritual in the Crown Prince's place

00:07:17.770 --> 00:07:19.210
Is it important?

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:23.280
I was delayed because of thieves
so I didn’t have time for the ritual

00:07:23.830 --> 00:07:25.010
I'm sorry

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:30.270
How many years have passed since then
how did you show your father your face?

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:38.520
You hid it for so many years

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:45.460
I made you worry

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.680
Father

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.510
It's time to show your face and become confident

00:07:57.510 --> 00:08:00.510
Dedicate your life to protecting the crown prince, create a good state

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:02.320
You will be a great source of strength.

00:08:03.450 --> 00:08:05.440
Father trusts you

00:08:07.390 --> 00:08:11.050
I accept... your order

00:08:22.760 --> 00:08:25.800
By standing here we can avoid the rain.
They'll bring us clothes soon

00:08:38.450 --> 00:08:41.610
Were you the one who hid So's scar?

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:51.410
You might get into trouble
because she touched the prince's face

00:08:52.000 --> 00:08:55.070
You did the right thing, don't worry

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:58.790
Besides,

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:04.450
So stood in the crown prince's place during the ritual,

00:09:04.450 --> 00:09:06.410
but it didn't change anything

00:09:07.700 --> 00:09:08.990
Really?

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.430
Of course

00:09:14.500 --> 00:09:16.170
But everything must change

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:19.870
Nothing will change?

00:09:20.710 --> 00:09:24.510
It's raining now
His Majesty will celebrate

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:28.820
A lot of time has passed since the last time a court servant was released

00:09:29.650 --> 00:09:31.520
I'm sure it will be so

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:33.180
I can't do anything

00:09:33.940 --> 00:09:36.210
- We need to find out
- Su...

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:57.230
Do you know who will be the next ruler?

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.850
Crown Prince, I guess nothing has happened yet

00:10:07.190 --> 00:10:11.320
Then... who will come after the crown prince?

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.330
After him?

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:16.860
Gwangjong... you said so

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:17.940
What?

00:10:21.090 --> 00:10:24.000
You called Prince Wang So "Gwangjong"

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:28.410
I didn't understand what I said

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.470
It just came out on its own

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:35.730
I think I'll be fourth or fifth

00:10:36.640 --> 00:10:38.350
They said I almost drowned

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:41.190
No, they said I was dead

00:10:41.190 --> 00:10:44.340
But I woke up a day later

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:52.610
You died... and came back to life?

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:55.410
My mother often said,

00:10:56.100 --> 00:10:59.050
that as soon as you come back to life, you become different

00:10:59.660 --> 00:11:01.740
She said I seemed wise beyond my years

00:11:04.520 --> 00:11:06.330
I never told anyone about this

00:11:06.330 --> 00:11:08.840
But this scene often pops up before my eyes,

00:11:08.840 --> 00:11:10.610
and I don't know if this is a dream or reality

00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:13.760
I see a big bird carrying people across the sky

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:16.320
I even saw a ladder that lifts people

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:21.070
And a building filled with people that was as tall as Heaven

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:24.230
Is this person also from the future, like me?

00:11:28.160 --> 00:11:31.050
Maybe he doesn't remember because he was still young?

00:11:37.260 --> 00:11:39.790
I heard you died and came back to life too

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:46.190
So I'm wondering if you have the gift of foreseeing the future like I do?

00:11:50.970 --> 00:11:53.370
Ask me the question you want to ask

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:56.910
What do you really want to know, madam?

00:11:57.770 --> 00:12:00.590
Is Wang So really Gwangjong? Will he kill everyone?!

00:12:00.590 --> 00:12:03.430
And Prince Wang Wook? What is his future?

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:12.930
I...

00:12:15.280 --> 00:12:16.570
what should I do?

00:12:16.570 --> 00:12:17.720
Nothing

00:12:18.630 --> 00:12:20.320
You don't have to do anything

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:23.260
Whatever you see, let it run its course

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:24.740
You can't interfere with this

00:12:24.740 --> 00:12:26.280
What if I can change something?

00:12:28.320 --> 00:12:30.580
I can prevent some things

00:12:31.070 --> 00:12:33.390
I can turn bad into good

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:36.140
You have already put your hands on Prince Wang So's face

00:12:40.110 --> 00:12:41.470
So,

00:12:44.310 --> 00:12:46.310
future prince

00:12:48.810 --> 00:12:50.260
will it change?

00:12:51.990 --> 00:12:53.620
I don't know this

00:12:54.400 --> 00:12:57.740
The moment when people understand the will of Heaven is destiny

00:12:57.740 --> 00:13:00.480
Is it predetermined, can it be changed...

00:13:00.480 --> 00:13:01.530
Who knows?

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:05.690
People cannot escape the will of Heaven

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.890
Don't touch what's destined to happen

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:13.500
Then you'll be safe

00:13:34.750 --> 00:13:37.210
So made it rain

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.990
Now he has the emperor's trust

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:48.280
Yes, I got it

00:13:48.280 --> 00:13:51.250
If the Crown Prince wasn't going to lead the ritual,

00:13:51.250 --> 00:13:53.790
you should have led it

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:55.530
There was a good opportunity

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:03.430
This place was given to So

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:06.020
He had to keep him busy

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:09.050
I shouldn't be so greedy

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:14.100
As soon as you receive your father’s patronage, other thoughts will immediately come to mind.

00:14:14.600 --> 00:14:19.080
I want to say that there is one more person to be wary of in the palace.

00:14:19.480 --> 00:14:22.340
Hae Soo also said that Seo will change

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.790
Are you going there too?

00:14:26.010 --> 00:14:27.110
So...

00:14:29.110 --> 00:14:31.570
Why shouldn't he gain the emperor's trust?

00:14:32.840 --> 00:14:35.440
Think about how he was mistreated

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:38.370
Hae Soo told you to be careful around Seo?

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.610
Why?

00:14:39.610 --> 00:14:42.740
The man who helped Seo take off his mask...

00:14:44.590 --> 00:14:45.780
This is Hae Soo

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:51.030
She's afraid something will happen because of this.

00:15:00.910 --> 00:15:02.210
As for me,

00:15:03.470 --> 00:15:06.780
there must be a place I can take

00:15:11.740 --> 00:15:13.140
What kind of place is this?

00:15:14.960 --> 00:15:16.410
Very

00:15:19.670 --> 00:15:21.140
interesting

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:51.340
It's me

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:56.070
Unexpectedly...

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:58.580
You came so unexpectedly

00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:01.320
I didn't mean anything like that

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:03.330
I'm just surprised, really

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:04.730
Sorry

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:12.420
What did I say?

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:15.750
It's not you who should apologize, it's me.

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:32.620
For the first time in my life I called the emperor father

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:40.950
15 years have passed since he looked at my face with that look.

00:16:40.950 --> 00:16:42.460
Told me to be more confident in myself

00:16:46.610 --> 00:16:50.850
After these words, all my pain seemed to go away

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:59.540
As he said, I must be a support for the crown prince.

00:17:01.190 --> 00:17:03.870
Everyone thanks me

00:17:04.850 --> 00:17:08.640
Nobody says I'm scary, they don't call me a beast

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.910
It's funny

00:17:12.370 --> 00:17:14.480
but I started to love myself

00:17:16.500 --> 00:17:17.690
And also

00:17:24.400 --> 00:17:26.690
the person who helped with this

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:30.110
Hae Soo, I'm talking about you

00:17:38.100 --> 00:17:40.940
Will this person become so cruel?

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:43.330
I can't believe it

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.850
Choi Chi Mon said I shouldn't interfere

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:51.290
but I can help change Gwangjong's future

00:17:58.170 --> 00:18:00.810
No matter how angry you are
don't let out your anger

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:04.280
Don't kill anyone

00:18:04.850 --> 00:18:07.910
In the future no one will hurt you

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:11.430
Everyone will love you and treat you well, you know?

00:18:11.430 --> 00:18:13.910
God, these lectures of yours

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:18.890
Beauty

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:31.430
I... can handle it

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:33.660
I won't leave it like this

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:37.330
I won't let anyone die

00:18:49.180 --> 00:18:54.580
Ms. Mon Ryan Won asked me to find a match for Soon Deok

00:18:55.510 --> 00:18:59.610
I'm thinking about choosing one of the princes

00:19:00.940 --> 00:19:03.480
One of the princes, you say?

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:15.520
The 14th Prince will be perfect for Lady Soon Deok

00:19:15.520 --> 00:19:18.920
They both love to fight
their zodiac signs go well together

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.250
Dear, what should you do if a husband and wife fight?

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:24.220
The whole house will then be destroyed

00:19:26.970 --> 00:19:30.450
Then what about the 13th Prince Baek Ah?

00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:32.630
The first handsome man in Songak

00:19:32.630 --> 00:19:35.370
All the girls in Goryeo will be jealous of her

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:38.600
And they could stone her to death, I don't like that idea.

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.150
4th Prince

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:47.230
I don't know about others

00:19:47.230 --> 00:19:49.500
but these two learned to fight together,

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.000
there is a connection between them

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:55.340
One was busy killing bears, the other was killing wolves

00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.930
They've never met before

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:02.200
If you don't like either one, what are we going to do?

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:06.820
Uh... the 8th prince?

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:11.320
He should remarry, but his character is too different from Mrs. Soon Duk's

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:16.070
Hey dear! Learn to count correctly.
Why are you letting people through?

00:20:16.070 --> 00:20:20.280
Look... at that last one

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:21.200
What?

00:20:26.760 --> 00:20:27.800
What?

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:34.760
Oh... are you serious?

00:20:49.230 --> 00:20:52.380
Su, I have something for you, see you later

00:20:53.430 --> 00:20:54.490
Yes

00:20:56.110 --> 00:20:57.860
His Majesty is coming

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.900
- Greetings, Your Majesty
- Greetings, Your Majesty

00:21:04.920 --> 00:21:06.910
You all did a good job

00:21:08.800 --> 00:21:09.910
Especially you, 4th prince,

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:13.370
you freed us from drought,
that's why I want to reward you

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:15.160
Is there something you want?

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:20.340
I wanted to give you land so that
cultivate it, and build a house there

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:24.440
Thanks, but I want more than just land

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:26.090
Okay, say what?

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:33.190
Please give me the maid Hae Soo from Damiwon

00:21:33.190 --> 00:21:34.270
What?

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:42.300
Okay

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:46.050
I think it's better to keep her close
to help you

00:21:47.390 --> 00:21:50.170
In recognition of your efforts

00:21:50.170 --> 00:21:52.630
Maid Hae Soo Promoted to the Position of Court Lady

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:55.750
Now you will actively assist the 4th prince

00:21:56.880 --> 00:21:58.320
Okay

00:21:59.190 --> 00:22:01.350
I understood your order

00:22:02.720 --> 00:22:07.750
To celebrate the rain, we will have a wedding in our palace

00:22:07.750 --> 00:22:09.630
We'll set a date soon

00:22:09.630 --> 00:22:12.560
The bride will be General Park's daughter - Sun Deok

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:17.100
And the groom is the 10th Prince

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:25.690
Brother, so you're getting married! Congratulations!

00:22:26.280 --> 00:22:29.540
I... don't want to get married

00:22:35.200 --> 00:22:36.620
Are you shy?

00:22:36.620 --> 00:22:41.000
You must properly fulfill your role in our family, and you also need relatives

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:45.290
There is also a 4th brother, and the 8th is alone again

00:22:45.870 --> 00:22:48.690
I'm still young

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:51.330
And this girl...

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:57.360
In general, I don’t want to! I refuse. I refuse to get married

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:04.920
Your Majesty, please cancel the order

00:23:04.920 --> 00:23:06.810
I really don't want that

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:10.370
If you insist on this marriage,

00:23:11.770 --> 00:23:13.620
I'd rather die

00:23:21.390 --> 00:23:25.720
Instead of obeying me, would you rather die?

00:23:33.620 --> 00:23:36.810
Would you rather disgrace your father?

00:23:39.170 --> 00:23:43.880
This look means that if the prince insists on refusal, he will actually kill him.

00:23:44.370 --> 00:23:47.850
Even for a prince, the emperor's word can change his life!

00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:55.000
Your Majesty! He must be so excited, he doesn't know what he's saying

00:23:55.610 --> 00:23:59.060
Eun, come on, thank the emperor. Rather

00:24:16.720 --> 00:24:19.680
Thank you for your kindness

00:24:34.430 --> 00:24:38.600
Eun, women are different only on the first night

00:24:38.600 --> 00:24:40.810
After that they are the same

00:24:40.810 --> 00:24:44.390
I even confuse my wives' names sometimes.

00:24:44.390 --> 00:24:46.740
I don't want to live like you

00:24:53.290 --> 00:24:54.880
Wait!

00:24:55.750 --> 00:24:57.200
It's better not to look

00:24:57.200 --> 00:24:58.970
I'm upset, that's why I want

00:24:58.970 --> 00:25:00.730
No. I think it's better not to do this

00:25:00.730 --> 00:25:01.930
Move away

00:25:02.620 --> 00:25:04.910
Come on! Attack!

00:25:40.590 --> 00:25:43.730
Great soldier! Great soldier! Great soldier!

00:26:09.220 --> 00:26:10.250
I...

00:26:20.180 --> 00:26:22.400
I think this is for your bracelet

00:26:25.100 --> 00:26:28.340
Or for me to leave the palace

00:26:42.820 --> 00:26:47.620
Sister said you were always full of worries

00:26:47.620 --> 00:26:51.370
Told me to make sure you sleep well

00:26:56.470 --> 00:26:57.560
Thank you

00:27:02.160 --> 00:27:04.830
I have something for you too

00:27:14.080 --> 00:27:16.510
Book?

00:27:19.290 --> 00:27:21.460
I will study diligently

00:27:23.700 --> 00:27:24.950
Take a closer look

00:27:34.310 --> 00:27:36.320
I know what it is

00:27:36.320 --> 00:27:38.750
We did this with friends...

00:27:38.750 --> 00:27:40.320
Did you draw everything yourself?

00:27:41.280 --> 00:27:42.510
Yes

00:27:42.510 --> 00:27:43.550
Wow

00:27:54.240 --> 00:27:55.870
Eun is getting married

00:27:57.500 --> 00:27:59.170
So this time

00:28:00.380 --> 00:28:03.900
they won't let you leave the palace

00:28:12.560 --> 00:28:14.850
I'm sure there will be another chance

00:28:15.700 --> 00:28:17.660
After all, I am the right hand of the concubine O

00:28:17.660 --> 00:28:21.390
I'd be worried about her if she left.

00:28:21.390 --> 00:28:22.810
And I got promoted!

00:28:24.350 --> 00:28:27.680
I don't know when this chance will come...

00:28:28.550 --> 00:28:31.110
If you are willing to wait,

00:28:32.500 --> 00:28:34.550
I can wait

00:28:40.050 --> 00:28:44.250
I think I've seen this somewhere before

00:28:50.340 --> 00:28:56.790
Because I'm next to you, I'm very happy

00:28:54.980 --> 00:28:57.550
I don't want to say that I was worried

00:28:57.810 --> 00:29:04.410
Because I'm next to you, I keep dreaming

00:28:57.970 --> 00:29:00.030
So please wait

00:29:01.370 --> 00:29:05.290
I felt like something was going wrong

00:29:05.390 --> 00:29:13.030
Because I'm next to you, I smile so brightly

00:29:08.810 --> 00:29:13.390
Let's take you for a walk when it snows again

00:29:13.030 --> 00:29:18.910
For you to be mine, I always pray to the Gods

00:29:15.160 --> 00:29:16.310
Just you and me

00:29:18.230 --> 00:29:19.960
I'll be waiting

00:29:20.570 --> 00:29:27.310
If you see my love and my feelings

00:29:28.340 --> 00:29:35.210
If you find my love and the path to me

00:29:31.940 --> 00:29:35.810
I... love you

00:29:35.850 --> 00:29:44.390
I will give my heart completely

00:29:44.390 --> 00:29:55.290
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:30:08.860 --> 00:30:13.750
The Emperor prefers tea made from wild plants rather than loose leaf tea

00:30:13.750 --> 00:30:15.720
Pay attention to details

00:30:17.070 --> 00:30:20.810
He has headaches and blurred vision

00:30:20.810 --> 00:30:23.470
He often eats cassia and wolfberry seeds

00:30:24.110 --> 00:30:26.690
Often wakes up at night due to thirst

00:30:26.690 --> 00:30:28.800
Then you can give him medicine

00:30:28.800 --> 00:30:29.930
Okay, concubine O

00:30:34.600 --> 00:30:36.460
Beware of Prince Wang So

00:30:38.020 --> 00:30:39.030
What?

00:30:39.030 --> 00:30:41.710
You tried to woo him
and now he has learned how to look after you

00:30:42.040 --> 00:30:45.180
If you can't give him your heart, make it clear

00:30:46.940 --> 00:30:51.720
What if I change his fate?

00:30:51.720 --> 00:30:53.720
Still turn away from him?

00:31:00.900 --> 00:31:04.360
Before I came to the palace, I gave my heart to a man

00:31:05.050 --> 00:31:09.250
To the unknown commander who collected flowers and herbs with me

00:31:09.250 --> 00:31:13.290
I thought he would forget about his ambitions and live peacefully with me

00:31:14.410 --> 00:31:18.390
As a result, he took a place where I couldn’t reach him.

00:31:21.890 --> 00:31:23.120
Understand?

00:31:24.080 --> 00:31:26.630
People don't change for others

00:31:27.460 --> 00:31:32.000
So forget that you can change a person

00:31:43.670 --> 00:31:46.300
You must apply it carefully with a brush,

00:31:46.300 --> 00:31:48.730
to make the scar less noticeable based on skin color

00:31:49.890 --> 00:31:51.870
Make sure your brush tip is flat before you start.

00:31:51.870 --> 00:31:54.840
Do you want me to do all this myself, because I have a lot of trouble myself?

00:31:55.470 --> 00:31:57.710
It'll be better if you know

00:32:05.170 --> 00:32:06.320
What is this?

00:32:11.770 --> 00:32:13.990
Cream recipe?

00:32:13.990 --> 00:32:17.700
Men in Goryeo often wore cosmetics,
so the tint will not be so noticeable

00:32:17.700 --> 00:32:20.570
Try to match the color to your skin color

00:32:20.570 --> 00:32:23.640
You can achieve the desired color using blush or bean powder

00:32:29.170 --> 00:32:32.080
Why have you changed so much?

00:32:32.570 --> 00:32:33.410
What?

00:32:38.170 --> 00:32:41.390
What happened to the girl
who always argued with me?

00:32:41.390 --> 00:32:43.520
You've become too obedient

00:32:47.170 --> 00:32:48.930
Your Highness

00:32:52.670 --> 00:32:56.400
The others are waiting for you at tea party

00:32:56.400 --> 00:32:58.070
Got it

00:32:58.070 --> 00:33:01.610
I was immature

00:33:01.610 --> 00:33:03.710
I'll be more careful in future

00:34:16.860 --> 00:34:18.900
I was just dancing with blades

00:34:19.440 --> 00:34:22.120
Don't be afraid, I won't do any harm

00:34:25.160 --> 00:34:26.180
For food

00:34:26.480 --> 00:34:28.780
- Me too!
- Me too!

00:34:28.780 --> 00:34:30.350
Chew thoroughly

00:34:30.350 --> 00:34:31.920
- Okay
- Share with each other

00:34:32.530 --> 00:34:34.840
- Go
- Thank you!

00:34:39.580 --> 00:34:42.260
We've already met, right?

00:34:42.320 --> 00:34:43.830
Are you from Hubaekje?

00:34:45.020 --> 00:34:47.420
Pay for the drawings you ruined!

00:34:47.420 --> 00:34:51.740
If you have nothing to give me, will you show me your dance?

00:34:52.020 --> 00:34:54.910
We've met before, right?

00:34:55.030 --> 00:34:56.080
Money Bug

00:34:56.080 --> 00:34:57.260
Money bug?

00:34:56.740 --> 00:35:02.050
I'm standing in front of you again, standing here alone

00:34:57.260 --> 00:34:58.520
Drawings and tools

00:34:58.520 --> 00:35:01.690
Worked hard to please the nobles?

00:35:02.050 --> 00:35:05.220
Tell me with your lips

00:35:02.090 --> 00:35:03.920
How diligent

00:35:03.920 --> 00:35:05.690
Are you here because of my music?

00:35:05.220 --> 00:35:07.760
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:35:05.690 --> 00:35:10.310
Well, yes, any dancer in Songak cannot move as soon as he hears my music

00:35:07.760 --> 00:35:12.330
I don’t understand why, but I always rush to you

00:35:10.310 --> 00:35:12.170
Show your dance

00:35:12.170 --> 00:35:14.910
You'll never know what beautiful music I could play

00:35:12.330 --> 00:35:17.940
With a breath of wind I will tell you: I love

00:35:14.930 --> 00:35:16.960
I don't dance in front of strangers

00:35:16.960 --> 00:35:18.330
Picky

00:35:19.460 --> 00:35:21.930
Then... let's introduce ourselves

00:35:21.530 --> 00:35:23.530
Need you!

00:35:22.380 --> 00:35:24.280
My name is Baek Ah, what's yours?

00:35:24.280 --> 00:35:25.480
Beck Huh?

00:35:26.100 --> 00:35:29.700
My dear, so to speak I want

00:35:27.000 --> 00:35:30.530
If you are Baek Ah then I am one of your servants

00:35:29.700 --> 00:35:32.140
What I can’t say

00:35:31.410 --> 00:35:33.980
There's no conscience left at all

00:35:32.840 --> 00:35:38.230
My dear, my dear, my dear: I love you!

00:35:33.980 --> 00:35:36.610
You're wasting your talent, don't live like that

00:35:36.610 --> 00:35:39.190
I really am Baek Ah

00:35:42.770 --> 00:35:46.920
Oh, you apparently don’t know, because you haven’t been to Songak for a long time

00:35:47.570 --> 00:35:49.870
I'm 13th...

00:35:56.170 --> 00:35:57.930
Missing again

00:36:05.270 --> 00:36:09.360
And this... is as unique as its owner

00:36:11.360 --> 00:36:13.240
Did you call it a bug?

00:36:13.260 --> 00:36:15.110
Isn't it necessary to live like this?

00:36:15.850 --> 00:36:19.900
I met her twice, and she’s already poking her nose into my life.

00:36:34.160 --> 00:36:35.260
Let's go

00:36:35.260 --> 00:36:36.720
What are you doing?

00:36:36.720 --> 00:36:39.620
Are you Hae Soo? Let's go quickly to the 10th prince

00:36:39.620 --> 00:36:40.710
What?

00:36:41.730 --> 00:36:44.050
Only you can reach him

00:36:44.050 --> 00:36:46.190
I'm afraid something will happen to him

00:36:46.190 --> 00:36:47.390
You should go to him

00:36:49.320 --> 00:36:52.530
I don't know what this is about, but I shouldn't interfere.

00:36:52.530 --> 00:36:54.290
You can even be his second wife!

00:36:57.840 --> 00:36:59.740
As long as you serve the prince well,

00:37:02.810 --> 00:37:04.190
I'm fine

00:37:06.540 --> 00:37:09.050
I will talk to the ruler and father about this

00:37:17.080 --> 00:37:18.860
Do I really have to do this, brother?

00:37:18.860 --> 00:37:21.200
Eun might die if he doesn't.

00:37:21.200 --> 00:37:22.640
Do it to save his life

00:37:26.730 --> 00:37:28.120
Stop!

00:37:41.950 --> 00:37:43.710
It's me, Hae Soo

00:37:44.520 --> 00:37:46.690
Open the door quickly

00:37:46.690 --> 00:37:49.200
No need to do that, move away

00:37:51.960 --> 00:37:53.980
Quickly open the door!

00:37:54.370 --> 00:37:57.190
Otherwise I won't talk to you again

00:38:31.360 --> 00:38:33.290
Will anything change if you get drunk?

00:38:33.870 --> 00:38:36.830
If you get drunk, won't you need to get married?

00:38:37.920 --> 00:38:40.070
You don't understand my feelings

00:38:40.960 --> 00:38:45.460
You like me, but now you have to marry someone you don't care about

00:38:50.470 --> 00:38:53.860
Did you know? But why... no...

00:38:55.040 --> 00:38:58.630
Then... then... Su...

00:39:00.730 --> 00:39:05.800
Will you be my second wife?

00:39:07.420 --> 00:39:10.580
The emperor and my brothers have many wives

00:39:10.580 --> 00:39:11.650
It's not bad

00:39:12.430 --> 00:39:16.600
You won't be the first, but I will only treat you well

00:39:16.600 --> 00:39:18.820
- Therefore, Su...
- I don't want to

00:39:21.540 --> 00:39:23.570
I can't live like this

00:39:25.400 --> 00:39:27.980
I can't share my husband with other women

00:39:28.590 --> 00:39:32.680
I don't want to grow old waiting for him to come to me

00:39:35.860 --> 00:39:37.040
Lie

00:39:39.210 --> 00:39:41.550
Even if he asked to become the first wife,

00:39:44.570 --> 00:39:46.500
you wouldn't agree

00:39:59.150 --> 00:40:02.330
I'm a fool, I know it

00:40:05.380 --> 00:40:09.590
I've always been stupid

00:40:11.710 --> 00:40:13.860
That's why you don't love me

00:40:18.290 --> 00:40:21.210
I was happy when I was with you

00:40:21.210 --> 00:40:25.500
You laugh when you're happy and cry when you're sad.

00:40:25.500 --> 00:40:29.710
That's why I never felt anxious around you.

00:40:29.710 --> 00:40:33.530
I could laugh, cry and be angry with all my heart

00:40:33.530 --> 00:40:35.220
I knew from the very beginning

00:40:36.520 --> 00:40:40.240
that you will never be mine

00:40:51.290 --> 00:40:56.090
If she apologized, would she only confirm those words?

00:40:58.940 --> 00:41:00.330
So...

00:41:02.570 --> 00:41:04.560
I won't apologize

00:41:05.620 --> 00:41:06.680
I'll tell you

00:41:12.040 --> 00:41:13.820
never liked it?

00:41:16.050 --> 00:41:18.100
I still really like you

00:41:28.040 --> 00:41:29.490
Be happy

00:41:56.610 --> 00:41:58.930
Brother! Grab him!

00:41:58.930 --> 00:42:00.220
No need

00:42:01.260 --> 00:42:04.000
I'll go there myself

00:42:07.310 --> 00:42:08.580
Are we having a wedding?

00:42:11.280 --> 00:42:14.200
We need to hurry! We're late!

00:42:22.140 --> 00:42:26.640
So, I prepared five rolls of mesh and thick fabric for my daughter-in-law

00:42:26.640 --> 00:42:29.500
Make my brother happy with good clothes

00:42:31.190 --> 00:42:33.940
This is a pearl.
Hope Heaven bless you with children

00:42:35.420 --> 00:42:39.340
Use this bronze mirror
and live a pure family life, Eun

00:42:41.830 --> 00:42:43.140
It's silver, Eun

00:42:48.210 --> 00:42:49.760
"Hyun Young Yeok Saek"

00:42:49.760 --> 00:42:54.010
This means that kindness of heart is more important than appearance in marriage.

00:42:54.010 --> 00:42:57.390
But all our gifts are a nice addition

00:42:57.390 --> 00:42:59.010
I will use everything

00:43:00.460 --> 00:43:03.240
Our 10th brother got married successfully

00:43:03.240 --> 00:43:06.010
Stupid. Is she happy?

00:43:07.240 --> 00:43:09.910
If you smile so widely, your mouth will tear

00:43:12.470 --> 00:43:15.730
I have sent you a tree that will bloom and bear fruit for you

00:43:15.730 --> 00:43:20.880
You can enjoy its view in the summer and pick the fruits in the fall

00:43:20.880 --> 00:43:23.850
As soon as the leaves grow, I will call you to take a look!

00:43:23.850 --> 00:43:27.200
It will be great to fight in his shadow

00:43:27.200 --> 00:43:28.920
Are you talking to your fiancee about fighting?

00:43:28.920 --> 00:43:30.480
Do you want to lose to me again?

00:43:33.160 --> 00:43:36.830
You must fight! Yes!

00:44:18.140 --> 00:44:19.290
Su!

00:44:22.570 --> 00:44:25.020
Are you okay? Su? Su!

00:44:25.020 --> 00:44:26.690
Beware of Prince Wang So

00:44:30.050 --> 00:44:31.870
Be careful with him

00:44:31.870 --> 00:44:33.250
Avoid him

00:44:33.250 --> 00:44:35.830
You can't stop him, and if you try...

00:44:37.500 --> 00:44:39.590
then you will all die

00:44:40.660 --> 00:44:42.970
Look at me. Look closely, Su!

00:44:44.260 --> 00:44:46.900
What are you talking about? About what death?

00:44:47.860 --> 00:44:49.760
I want to leave this place

00:44:53.890 --> 00:44:56.620
Go as far as possible

00:45:04.010 --> 00:45:05.770
Okay, let's do it that way

00:45:06.570 --> 00:45:08.380
I'll do anything for you

00:45:09.050 --> 00:45:10.840
Don't worry Su, calm down

00:45:11.820 --> 00:45:13.420
It's okay, Su

00:45:24.750 --> 00:45:25.950
Listen carefully

00:45:26.680 --> 00:45:28.750
Maybe we're married

00:45:28.750 --> 00:45:31.260
but I don't recognize you as my wife

00:45:31.260 --> 00:45:35.820
So I will live the way I lived before

00:45:35.990 --> 00:45:37.740
So don't complain

00:45:38.130 --> 00:45:39.500
Do you understand?

00:45:42.770 --> 00:45:45.800
You must answer when I ask!

00:45:45.800 --> 00:45:48.310
How frustrating is this?

00:45:49.070 --> 00:45:52.490
Since we are bound by marriage, I will follow your every wish,

00:45:52.540 --> 00:45:56.870
May I live with you long and in harmony

00:45:57.450 --> 00:46:01.020
Even though you don't speak much, I still can't understand you

00:46:01.020 --> 00:46:03.690
How can I love you?

00:46:03.970 --> 00:46:07.520
I need a big bed, very big!

00:46:42.020 --> 00:46:45.020
Will you hear him?

00:46:45.270 --> 00:46:50.570
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:46:52.020 --> 00:46:54.470
Are you still listening?

00:46:54.470 --> 00:46:58.620
Can you hear my heart?

00:47:00.470 --> 00:47:04.740
How raindrops settled on the window

00:47:05.420 --> 00:47:11.190
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:47:11.940 --> 00:47:13.390
Need you

00:47:14.490 --> 00:47:16.070
Need you

00:47:17.070 --> 00:47:19.340
I miss you

00:47:18.820 --> 00:47:22.670
She said that I should wait until the first snow...

00:47:23.370 --> 00:47:25.070
Hae Soo...

00:47:26.470 --> 00:47:29.470
you're such a liar

00:47:32.630 --> 00:47:35.630
Will you hear him?

00:47:35.880 --> 00:47:41.180
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:47:42.630 --> 00:47:45.080
Are you still listening?

00:47:45.080 --> 00:47:49.230
Can you hear my heart?

00:47:51.970 --> 00:47:53.490
Beware of Wang So?

00:47:53.490 --> 00:47:56.100
"Don't try to stop him"

00:47:56.870 --> 00:47:59.180
"Beware of Wang So"

00:48:00.870 --> 00:48:04.800
"Don't try to stop him"

00:48:15.990 --> 00:48:20.560
The reason I wanted to see you both was to give you new challenges.

00:48:21.940 --> 00:48:24.850
3rd Prince, you must leave Songak

00:48:24.850 --> 00:48:27.620
Visit each area and inspect the grain warehouses

00:48:31.380 --> 00:48:32.760
There are many warehouses,

00:48:32.760 --> 00:48:35.400
I know they are under attack

00:48:35.400 --> 00:48:39.640
Last year, the man in charge of the warehouses came back dead.

00:48:39.640 --> 00:48:41.770
That's why I'm sending you

00:48:41.770 --> 00:48:45.320
The Prince must step forward to change the course of things

00:48:46.170 --> 00:48:48.600
Create a small group

00:48:51.490 --> 00:48:54.460
I obey your order

00:48:55.030 --> 00:48:59.680
Your Majesty, what about the military supplies that the 3rd Prince was in charge of?

00:49:00.380 --> 00:49:03.330
I appoint the 4th prince responsible for them

00:49:07.760 --> 00:49:09.450
I obey your order

00:49:16.720 --> 00:49:20.350
Has the Emperor gotten rid of me?

00:49:20.350 --> 00:49:23.180
What? I doubt it

00:49:23.180 --> 00:49:26.570
He entrusted a difficult task to the person he trusted most

00:49:28.630 --> 00:49:31.500
You said something when you gave my place to So

00:49:32.000 --> 00:49:35.370
Brothers who fight each other for their father's favor...

00:49:36.810 --> 00:49:39.130
Is this also a wish from Heaven?

00:49:39.130 --> 00:49:42.450
Ever since you were a child, you have coveted what belonged to the crown prince.

00:49:44.650 --> 00:49:47.950
Now you must find your place in the world

00:49:48.320 --> 00:49:50.020
Then follow me

00:49:50.020 --> 00:49:53.480
You'll see what place I find

00:50:20.610 --> 00:50:23.730
We just gathered at one table as a family, why is this so surprising?

00:50:23.730 --> 00:50:25.330
Do you agree, mother?

00:50:26.350 --> 00:50:28.850
It's so nice to see your face

00:50:30.480 --> 00:50:33.520
You have earned the emperor's trust, I'm proud of you

00:50:34.140 --> 00:50:36.590
I've been waiting for this day for so long

00:50:37.540 --> 00:50:39.470
Let's forget the past

00:50:39.470 --> 00:50:41.640
Let's get started. Let's eat

00:50:47.910 --> 00:50:51.810
This is the first time I will eat with you, brother.

00:50:53.020 --> 00:50:55.900
I was already in Shinju when you were born

00:50:55.900 --> 00:50:59.590
We must forget past mistakes and meet often, we are brothers

00:50:59.590 --> 00:51:00.780
Yes brother

00:51:10.750 --> 00:51:13.430
When you were a child, you really liked meat.

00:51:20.230 --> 00:51:22.460
Still like it

00:51:23.700 --> 00:51:25.020
Eat

00:51:50.280 --> 00:51:54.510
You're doing Yo's job now, you have a lot to learn

00:51:54.510 --> 00:51:56.540
I need to leave Songak

00:51:56.540 --> 00:51:58.360
learn from the crown prince

00:51:58.360 --> 00:51:59.390
That's what I'll do

00:51:59.400 --> 00:52:03.030
There will be more opportunities to see the Crown Prince more often

00:52:03.030 --> 00:52:05.430
You will often be alone together

00:52:06.870 --> 00:52:07.950
What?

00:52:15.720 --> 00:52:16.940
As expected

00:52:18.660 --> 00:52:20.620
Do you want something from me

00:52:20.620 --> 00:52:22.390
Kill the Crown Prince

00:52:28.670 --> 00:52:31.610
This isn't the first time you've killed someone for me.

00:52:34.200 --> 00:52:35.380
Can you handle it?

00:52:36.550 --> 00:52:39.760
Mother, you shouldn't joke like that

00:52:39.770 --> 00:52:44.080
Was there an emperor in Goryeo who did not kill his brothers in the struggle for the throne?

00:52:45.340 --> 00:52:47.980
If I don't become ruler, we will all die

00:52:48.540 --> 00:52:50.210
We have to take a step

00:52:50.210 --> 00:52:53.510
The Crown Prince is not like that.
He wouldn't kill his brothers

00:53:00.720 --> 00:53:02.480
Do you really want this?

00:53:03.760 --> 00:53:04.950
I wish

00:53:05.460 --> 00:53:08.810
Then... I'll do it

00:53:10.280 --> 00:53:11.440
And after that

00:53:13.310 --> 00:53:15.390
I will take the throne

00:53:15.390 --> 00:53:16.560
What?

00:53:17.440 --> 00:53:19.970
You want a son to take the throne

00:53:19.970 --> 00:53:21.650
It won't matter which one

00:53:21.650 --> 00:53:27.120
If I take the throne, I won't harm either Yeon or Jeong.

00:53:28.550 --> 00:53:29.990
Don't elevate yourself

00:53:29.990 --> 00:53:34.410
If I led the ritual, I would make it rain myself

00:53:34.410 --> 00:53:37.060
Think you might have your eye on the throne
or something like that?

00:53:37.790 --> 00:53:40.020
I have the will of Heaven

00:53:41.070 --> 00:53:43.440
You have nothing but a legal right

00:53:43.440 --> 00:53:45.670
The Crown Prince ranks low in this regard

00:53:45.690 --> 00:53:47.730
So do you agree that it should be removed?

00:53:47.730 --> 00:53:51.260
Your brother is blessed by Heaven to
to become emperor

00:53:51.260 --> 00:53:53.300
Who do you think you're fighting?

00:53:58.200 --> 00:54:00.370
You made such a fuss over a joke

00:54:00.820 --> 00:54:02.790
My head is full of other ideas

00:54:05.210 --> 00:54:06.370
Emperor?

00:54:08.690 --> 00:54:13.770
The place everyone is aiming for...
what if I happen to occupy it?

00:54:17.500 --> 00:54:21.010
You think you can do anything
because of a couple of brush strokes

00:54:24.220 --> 00:54:26.600
Do you really think
that you became someone?

00:54:27.490 --> 00:54:29.640
You have been chosen to perform the rain ritual.

00:54:29.640 --> 00:54:32.260
They assumed everything would be alright
if instead of the crown prince

00:54:32.260 --> 00:54:33.460
they will beat you to death

00:54:33.460 --> 00:54:36.800
You were a shield from any arrows or failures,
what could have been waiting for him on the way

00:54:36.800 --> 00:54:39.520
You have no idea that your father manipulated you

00:54:42.330 --> 00:54:44.190
I wasn't manipulated

00:54:44.830 --> 00:54:46.940
I knew and took this place

00:54:55.180 --> 00:54:58.090
The food I ate here wasn't that bad

00:54:58.090 --> 00:55:00.060
Still, you should eat with your family.

00:55:00.760 --> 00:55:02.550
Don't call me here anymore

00:55:16.440 --> 00:55:19.960
As I thought, it would be difficult to reconcile with him

00:55:21.460 --> 00:55:22.890
It is necessary to break ties

00:55:24.000 --> 00:55:25.490
This is all too much!

00:55:25.490 --> 00:55:28.880
Are you asking him to kill a man during a family dinner?

00:55:28.880 --> 00:55:31.120
If you were going to raise us as enemies,

00:55:31.120 --> 00:55:32.740
Why were you allowed to be born, mother?

00:55:34.690 --> 00:55:36.090
What is he talking about...

00:55:36.670 --> 00:55:37.890
Jeong!

00:56:07.770 --> 00:56:08.950
How stupid

00:56:11.200 --> 00:56:13.070
What were you waiting for?

00:57:42.230 --> 00:57:43.300
Su

00:57:52.500 --> 00:57:53.980
Please let me go

00:57:53.980 --> 00:57:55.190
Just for a second

00:57:57.080 --> 00:57:58.700
Stay with me

00:58:01.190 --> 00:58:02.910
I need to rest

00:58:07.170 --> 00:58:08.890
I don't want to!

00:58:10.070 --> 00:58:12.100
I'm afraid of you, your highness

00:58:17.030 --> 00:58:19.010
You said you weren't afraid of me

00:58:19.680 --> 00:58:22.110
I thought I could change everything

00:58:22.550 --> 00:58:24.160
I was wrong

00:58:24.800 --> 00:58:28.190
In the end you will destroy everyone!

00:58:28.190 --> 00:58:30.620
Go away. Get away!

00:58:30.620 --> 00:58:32.410
No, not you!

00:58:40.580 --> 00:58:42.460
Don't push me away

00:58:42.930 --> 00:58:44.320
Don't tell me to go away

00:58:45.180 --> 00:58:49.330
Don't say that I bring misfortune.
Don't say I'm an animal

00:58:53.440 --> 00:58:55.300
At least don't do this to me

00:58:57.480 --> 00:59:01.610
You... are my man

00:59:03.060 --> 00:59:05.110
I'm not your man, your highness

00:59:05.650 --> 00:59:06.920
You are my man

00:59:06.920 --> 00:59:08.490
You belong to me. You are mine!

00:59:10.630 --> 00:59:15.030
You can't leave me without my permission

00:59:16.440 --> 00:59:17.990
And you can't die either

00:59:21.020 --> 00:59:22.680
Totally my man

00:59:35.370 --> 00:59:42.170
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

